COMPILATION OF: E52XF

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52XF

   1 a 0000 E52XF: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* E2E-52/P3-11 probe XF (PLAN H-F): LOAN2 53-56 + 99
   3 a 0006       composed minimally -- TB-shape open in the THEN,
   4 a 0006       TC-shape open in the ELSE, then ONE file PAGE.
   5 a 0006       Eligibility after a conditional open is the
   6 a 0006       compiler-side question; DR measures the bytes. */
   7 c 0006    dcl pf file;
   8 c 0006    dcl n fixed binary;
   9 c 0006    dcl name char(14) varying;
  10 c 0006    dcl x fixed bin;
  11 c 0006    if n < 0 then
  12 c 000D       open file(pf) title('$con') print pagesize(0);
  13 c 002D    else
  14 c 002D       open file(pf) title(name) print;
  15 c 0048    put file(pf) page;
  16 c 005A    x = 2;
  17 a 0060 end E52XF;

CODE SIZE = 0063
DATA AREA = 0017
FREE SYMS = 3885
END  COMPILATION
